{{/* gotype: entgo.io/ent/entc/gen.Type */}}

{{/*
Extends sqlAll and sqlCount (extension point "dialect/sql/query/spec/*").
On an edge traversal (entity.QueryX(), client.Y.QueryX(entity), query-level
QueryX()) the root selector is the traversal's From selector, which ent
v0.14.6 builds without the query context and hands to sqlgraph as is
(sqlgraph (*query).selector replaces its own context-carrying selector with
From). Predicates that read s.Context() then see an anonymous caller: the
neighbour scopes (mixin.ScopeNeighborToTenants) match nothing, so every
relation filter on an edge connection returned no rows, even for the system
user. Upstream fixed this in ent #4501 after v0.14.6; drop this template once
the pinned ent includes it.
*/}}
{{ define "dialect/sql/query/spec/fromcontext" }}
	if _spec.From != nil {
		_spec.From.WithContext(ctx)
	}
{{- end }}
